Data in this repository
-----------------------
Test fixtures, benchmark records and screenshots contain or show data derived
from OpenStreetMap, © OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open
Database License (ODbL) 1.0: https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

tests/fixtures/basemap/*.pmtiles is an extract of a Protomaps basemap build
(https://protomaps.com), derived from OpenStreetMap data (ODbL).

Apps built with this SDK that display OSM data or Protomaps basemaps must show
the attribution "© OpenStreetMap contributors" (and credit Protomaps when
using its basemap builds).
